/* AUDIT TRAIL: 8.7.0 [UTM:002.1.0]                         INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* 1. Creacion del Codigo.                                    DLO 14/DIC/2015 */
/*    --------------------                                                    */
/* Este proceso realiza el llamado del paquete TZKREFC para                   */
/* el procesamiento de los registros de Reembolso.                            */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/*                                                                            */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 8.7.0 [UTM:002.1.1]                           INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* 1. Creacion del Codigo.                                    MKU 16/MAR/2016 */
/*    --------------------                                                    */
/* Issue 120 - The process needs to evaluate all students of an CRN and       */
/* apply the rules above                                                      */
/*                                                                            */
/*                                                                            */
/*   1) If the counting of DA grades of non final project/exam activity is gt */
/*      than DA limit, then its final project/exam is update to DA.           */
/*                                                                            */
/*   2) Else, all final project/exam activity must be update to null, since   */
/*      that the previous grade is DA                                         */
/*                                                                            */
/*   3) If a course has corequisite then they need to be consider on the      */
/*      counting.                                                             */
/*                                                                            */
/*   4) All rules described on itens 1 and 2 must be apllied on all corequi   */
/*      sites courses.                                                        */
/*                                                                            */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/*                                                                            */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 8.7.0 [UTM:002.1.2]                           INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* 1.  Update score and percentage fields with 0 instead of   MSO 23/JUL/2016 */
/*     shrgcom_percentage value.                                              */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 8.7.0 [UTM:002.1.3]                           INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* 1.  Add conditions to keep DA grade when it applies        MSO 01/SEP/2016 */
/*                                                                            */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 8.7.0 [UTM:002.1.4]                           INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* 1.  Labels for .lis were modified                          MSO 09/SEP/2016 */
/*                                                                            */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 8.7.0 [UTM:002.1.5]                           INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* Se hace llamado al calculo de promedio cuando se quita     MSO 21/SEP/2016 */
/* una nota no numerica de calificacion final.                                */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* AUDIT TRAIL: 8.7.0 [UTM:002.1.6]                           INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/*  1. Se agrega validacion de materia reprobada marcada en   GGR 30-JUN-2017 */
/*     la tabla STVRSTS en la columna STVRSTS_WITHDRAW_IND                    */
/*     Valor 'Y' significa que es un estado de reprobacion                    */
/*     en otro caso, dependera si es evaluable para entrar a proceso          */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/*  AUDIT TRAIL: 8.31.2 [MOD:02.2.0]                          INI    DATE     */
/* ---------------------------------------------------------- --- ----------- */
/* 1. STUDENT version updgrade from 8.7 to 8.31.2             LMR 11/Dic/2024 */
/*    -------------------------------------------                             */
/* Student version updated.                                                   */
/*                                                                            */
/*                                                                            */
/* AUDIT TRAIL END                                                            */
/*                                                                            */
/******************************************************************************/

